# No .gitattributes + core.autocrlf=true on Windows meant a checkout where biome's format gate could never
# pass (it wants LF; the worktree had CRLF), and it is the reason `just check` is ungreen on Windows.
# Pin LF in the worktree for everyone; text detection stays automatic for diffs.
* text=auto eol=lf

*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.gif binary
*.ico binary
*.snapshot binary
